# mouse_trap / mousetrapjenga

## Path
`/Users/bbp/mouse_trap`

## Purpose
Landing page for mousetrapjenga (patient adrenaline game). Originally cloned from unavoidablyunsafe.com layout/styling; brand and copy evolving for mousetrapjenga.

## Stack
- Next.js 15 (App Router)
- TypeScript
- CSS Modules
- Deploy target: Vercel

## Conventions
- Poppins, red accent highlights (~ hsl(354, 99%, 47%)), full-bleed hero
- Components in `components/`, page in `app/`, static assets in `public/`

